# Norima — net payload on haul heroes

**Source:** [NORIMA-PAYLOAD-CY14.md](../journal/retcons/NORIMA-PAYLOAD-CY14.md) · [vehicles.md](../inventory/vehicles.md) · [harvest.md](../government/procedures/harvest.md).

## When this applies

Any hero that credits **bulk stock** via **`WAGON-V2-CHASSIS-1` (Norima)**.

## Tow capacity *(net @ bed · d5079+)*

| Band | kg |
|---|---:|
| Long corridor / exped return | **~180–220** |
| Campus full-day haul | **~120–200** |
| Max push | **~250–300** |
| Caution / bad leg | **~80–120** |

## Fill time — calendar days

| Class | Material | Full-bed exped |
|---|---|---|
| **A** | Sand · gravel · clay @ campus | **1 d** hero |
| **B** | Pozz · stone face · lime knap | **+1–2 d** at site → **4 d** pozz loop |
| **C** | Ore dress at face | **+2–3 d** at site → **5–6 d** ore loop |

## Day file

1. **Net cargo** in **Gains** · **material class** on expeds.
2. **`KORUHOYUK-POZZ-HAUL`:** **4 d** @ **~180–220 kg** default · **3 d** only **partial** **~80–120 kg**.
3. **`ORE-HAUL`:** mine/dress days **before** laden return — no full bed in one pick day.

## Do not

- Cart-lap / pre-Y14 **~18–70 kg** tables on Norima.
- Conflate **tow capacity** with **one-day mine rate** on class **B/C**.
